# WARP-8: GRIDS as a throw. FX held, the fifteenth white key held: the kit's kick, snare and hat play from the drum
# map, the knobs X, Y and FILL; let go, the written pattern again. SEL while it is on keeps what plays
wait 300
listen
expect trk 1
expect drumhits 0
tap PLAY
wait 1100
expect drumhits 0
press FX
key w14 down
wait 60
said GRIDS
expect page Throws
turn K3 40
wait 1900
expect drumhits >4
shot grids_on.png
tap SEL
wait 40
said WRITTEN
key w14 up
release FX
wait 40
expect page Steps
tap PLAY
# kept: the pattern has steps now
expect lanes 0
tap PLAY
wait 1900
tap PLAY
expect drumhits >8
